1772719221509408	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuRg		item.create	bn-3i7	{"description":"The core architectural change. asupersync requires a Cx (capability context) parameter for Mutex::lock(), broadcast send/recv, and race/select. Thread Cx through:\n- Server::run() and the accept loop\n- handle_request() and all request handlers\n- handle_attach() / run_attach_bridge()\n- handle_events()\n- pty_reader_task()\n\nThis touches src/server/mod.rs (~20 Mutex refs, ~12 broadcast refs, 3 select! sites) and is the largest single task.","kind":"task","parent":"bn-1ck","size":"l","title":"Thread Cx through server and handler functions"}	blake3:n4UyDpdSvStZChtSnSvC-ZCQ9e3WZ1HrQiix7J9DAdc
1772719228595271	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuRw		item.create	bn-ar7	{"description":"Replace tokio primitives in attach.rs:\n- tokio::io::stdin()/stdout() -> investigate ChildStdin/ChildStdout or spawn_blocking shim for raw terminal fd\n- tokio::select! -> asupersync Select or race! macro (needs Cx)\n- tokio::signal::unix::signal(SignalKind::window_change()) -> asupersync signal::sigwinch()\n- tokio::time::timeout -> asupersync timeout(wall_now(), dur, fut)\n- AsyncReadExt/AsyncWriteExt imports\n\nThe stdin/stdout replacement is the trickiest part — we need raw terminal I/O, not child process pipes.","kind":"task","parent":"bn-1ck","size":"m","title":"Migrate attach.rs to asupersync"}	blake3:eF6bDJ31ECidM_ppYAVA1UhH_RkJGpxa60AQ91RVc2o
1772719238419873	botty-dev	itc:v3:AWLnk5P-ZJJJxAAAAAAAQe9df9qquAAAAAEuSA		item.create	bn-2su	{"description":"Replace tokio primitives in client.rs (3 refs) and main.rs (32 refs):\n- UnixStream::connect -> asupersync UnixStream\n- tokio::time::sleep/timeout -> asupersync sleep(wall_now())/timeout(wall_now())\n- tokio::spawn -> RuntimeHandle::spawn (need handle access)\n- tokio::task::spawn_blocking -> asupersync spawn_blocking\n- #[tokio::main] -> asupersync RuntimeBuilder entry point\n- All select! macros in main.rs (wait, subscribe, exec commands)","kind":"task","parent":"bn-1ck","size":"m","title":"Migrate client.rs and main.rs to asupersync"}	blake3:io3cEqaRpwtmcR6lQTa306QRponsGJoMaKde1y8aymc
